1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:17,861
Speaking, task 1. Big review: topics 1–5. Today you will review everything: how the task works, two mock exams, the most important phrases, five typical mistakes and finally a test without hints.

2
00:00:18,767 --> 00:00:30,548
How does the task work? The examiner chooses two topics and asks four questions on each. That is eight questions in total, and each good answer gets one point.

3
00:00:31,433 --> 00:00:43,928
You know the topics in advance, but not the questions. Always answer with a full sentence, ideally two. And listen to the tense: questions are in the present, past and future.

4
00:00:44,833 --> 00:00:53,788
Mock exam number one. Topics: About me and Housing. You have eight seconds for each answer. Let’s start.

5
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:55,508
Where are you from?

6
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:08,058
I am from Ukraine, from the city of Kharkiv. It is a big city in the east.

7
00:01:09,167 --> 00:01:10,652
How long have you been in Czechia?

8
00:01:18,967 --> 00:01:22,829
I have been in Czechia for five years. I came in 2021.

9
00:01:23,933 --> 00:01:25,983
What did you do before you came to Czechia?

10
00:01:34,267 --> 00:01:36,839
In Ukraine I worked as a shop assistant.

11
00:01:37,933 --> 00:01:40,047
What would you like to do in five years?

12
00:01:48,333 --> 00:01:51,660
In five years I would like to have a better job and speak Czech well.

13
00:01:52,767 --> 00:01:54,411
Do you live in a flat or a house?

14
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:04,974
I live in a flat in a prefab block on the third floor.

15
00:02:06,067 --> 00:02:07,504
Do you like your flat?

16
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:19,499
Yes, I like it because it's bright and there's a park nearby.

17
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:22,788
When did you last move house?

18
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:34,147
I last moved two years ago, to a bigger flat.

19
00:02:35,233 --> 00:02:37,623
What kind of home would you like in ten years?

20
00:02:45,933 --> 00:02:48,698
In ten years I'd like my own house with a garden.

21
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:53,774
How many points out of eight did you get? Write your score in the comments.

22
00:02:54,967 --> 00:03:00,594
Mock exam number two. Topics: Family and My town.

23
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:02,765
Do you have any brothers or sisters?

24
00:03:11,067 --> 00:03:15,905
Yes, I have one brother. He is three years older and lives in Ukraine.

25
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,426
How old are your children?

26
00:03:26,733 --> 00:03:30,905
My son is nine and my daughter is five. My son is in the third year at school.

27
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,247
When did you last see your parents?

28
00:03:42,533 --> 00:03:46,416
I last saw my parents last summer when they came to visit.

29
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:49,620
Where will you go with your family next time?

30
00:03:57,933 --> 00:04:00,664
Next summer we will go to the sea in Croatia with the family.

31
00:04:01,767 --> 00:04:03,845
What is interesting in your town?

32
00:04:12,133 --> 00:04:15,221
The Vltava river and a nice park by the station are interesting.

33
00:04:16,333 --> 00:04:18,477
How do you get to work in town?

34
00:04:26,767 --> 00:04:30,415
I go to work by bus, the journey takes fifteen minutes.

35
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:33,780
What did you do in town last Saturday?

36
00:04:42,067 --> 00:04:45,633
Last Saturday I went to the market on the square and bought vegetables.

37
00:04:46,733 --> 00:04:48,997
Will you live in this town in the future too?

38
00:04:57,300 --> 00:05:01,767
Yes, I think I'll live here in the future too, because I like it here.

39
00:05:02,867 --> 00:05:06,841
How many points out of eight did you get? Write your score in the comments.

40
00:05:08,033 --> 00:05:12,740
Now the twelve most important phrases. Listen and repeat out loud.

41
00:05:13,433 --> 00:05:15,287
My name is Oleh Kovalenko.

42
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:20,800
I am from Ukraine, from Kharkiv.

43
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:26,033
I live in Kralupy nad Vltavou.

44
00:05:29,233 --> 00:05:30,733
I have been in Czechia for five years.

45
00:05:33,933 --> 00:05:35,133
I work in a warehouse.

46
00:05:38,333 --> 00:05:40,128
I have a wife and two sons.

47
00:05:43,333 --> 00:05:45,665
In my free time I like going for walks.

48
00:05:48,867 --> 00:05:51,429
I like the flat because it is bright.

49
00:05:54,633 --> 00:05:56,567
Last Saturday I was at the market.

50
00:05:59,767 --> 00:06:01,533
Next summer we will go to the sea.

51
00:06:04,733 --> 00:06:07,000
In five years I would like to have a better job.

52
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:12,400
I think I am calm and friendly.

53
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:18,658
Five typical mistakes that cost people points.

54
00:06:21,867 --> 00:06:28,092
Correct: Bydlím v Kralupech nad Vltavou. Answer with a full sentence, not one word.

55
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:37,409
Correct: Jsem z Ukrajiny. After the preposition z we use the 2nd case: z Ukrajiny, z Kyjeva.

56
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:48,034
Correct: Bydlím v Praze. After the preposition v we use the 6th case: v Praze, v Brně.

57
00:06:51,733 --> 00:06:57,764
Correct: Je mi čtyřicet let. This is how we say age: je mi … let.

58
00:07:01,467 --> 00:07:09,219
Correct: Rodiče jsem naposledy viděl loni v létě. The question is in the past tense, so the answer must be too.

59
00:07:10,433 --> 00:07:19,524
And now a test without hints. Eight questions, ten seconds per answer. You won’t hear the answers this time — you’ll find them on the website.

60
00:07:20,233 --> 00:07:21,774
Do you have friends in the Czech Republic?

61
00:07:32,067 --> 00:07:33,365
What do you do with your friends?

62
00:07:43,667 --> 00:07:46,657
When did you last visit a friend and why?

63
00:07:56,967 --> 00:07:59,157
What will you do with your friends at the weekend?

64
00:08:09,467 --> 00:08:10,521
What do you do?

65
00:08:20,833 --> 00:08:22,274
How many people are there in your family?

66
00:08:32,567 --> 00:08:34,081
How big is your flat?

67
00:08:44,367 --> 00:08:46,100
Where do you like going most in town?

68
00:08:56,400 --> 00:09:01,563
Done! How many questions did you manage? Write it in the comments.

69
00:09:02,767 --> 00:09:18,228
Excellent! All questions with answers and a pronunciation check are free on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, link in the description. Tomorrow: big review of Speaking task 2. Subscribe so you don’t miss anything.
